<Defs>
  <!--
  RM_Zrrik: owned RM_ port of the Alpha Animals BloodShrimp (sarg.alphaanimals AA_BloodShrimp, 1.6/Defs/ThingDefs_Races). Phase 0 step P2 (biome_sprint_kickoff_2026-10-15.md 0.5.3), tool src/RimMandrake/Utils/aa_port.py. Free RM_ tier, home mod Greentide.
  Stats, tools, race fields and pawnkind numbers are the donor's own, as the creature the game shows today
  (our rename/tolerance patches on the donor def are folded in). Departures:
    - wildBiomes dropped (the biome roster casts it); AnimalStatExtension (donor stat defs) dropped.
    - VEF.* comps and VEF_ abilities kept, guarded MayRequire OskarPotocki.VanillaFactionsExpanded.Core (a framework we keep, not the donor).
    - texPath is OUR final path; the PNGs are owed through artpipe (no donor art is reused). Until the art is
      installed through the art ledger this def has no picture: ART OWED, never a pass of the art bar.
    - dessicated donor art and alternate random graphics dropped (vanilla fallback).
    - folded 2 op(s) from src/RimUtinni/UtinniPatches/Patches/AnimalTolerances_Ashkarr.xml
    - folded 2 op(s) from src/RimUtinni/UtinniPatches/Patches/BiomeCastEvictions_WildBiomes.xml
    - folded 3 op(s) from src/RimUtinni/UtinniPatches/Patches/Contagion_Rename.xml
    - useMeatFrom AA_RaptorShrimp -> Megaspider (vanilla; PROVISIONAL)
    - texPath Things/Item/Resource/AA_Chitin -> Things/Item/Resource/RM_Leather_RaptorPlates (ART OWED, RM_Leather_RaptorPlates)
-->
  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_Zrrik</defName>
    <label>zrrik</label>
    <description>A small, fast, red-shelled and stalk-eyed predator of the shallow pools, quicker than its larger kin though it lacks their steady regeneration. It has an odd one of its own instead: every stab of a zrrik's mouthparts drinks blood, and the blood it drinks knits its own wounds shut while it fights, so a wounded zrrik that keeps biting keeps healing. It is the reason nobody drinks from the red pools unwatched.</description>
